# The build context of tools/manual-build/Dockerfile is the repository root,
# and the image only needs the lock files, the members' metadata and this
# package's sources. BuildKit looks for `<dockerfile>.dockerignore` first and
# for `<context>/.dockerignore` second, and never for this path, so
# `Dockerfile.dockerignore` next to it is a symlink to this file. The root
# `.dockerignore` serves the service images and is not the one read here.

.git
.github
.venv
**/.venv
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.mypy_cache

# Local tool state and data/metropt3 stay out: a linked worktree may symlink
# both out of the checkout, and the MetroPT-3 CSV alone is about 208 MB.
.claude
data/metropt3
reports

# Build output, never an input.
**/.build
**/dist
**/coverage
